sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Security Admin
    participant Console as Admin Console UI
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant StepUp as Step-Up Auth Verifier
    participant Core as Core Backend

    Admin->>Console: Request High-Risk Action (e.g. Change Risk Limits)
    Console->>Console: Prompt Step-Up Auth Modal (Password + TOTP MFA)
    Admin->>Console: Submits Password + TOTP Code
    Console->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/admin/step-up (Payload)
    Gateway->>StepUp: Verify Password Hash & TOTP Token
    StepUp-->>Gateway: Verification SUCCESS (Token valid 5m)
    Gateway->>Core: Execute Privileged Action
    Core->>Core: Log Elevated Security Audit Record
    Core-->>Console: Action Executed Successfully
